        "@value": "by substituting for paragraph (b) the following paragraph: \"(b) five ringgit for every one thousand ringgit or part thereof of the improved value of the controlled premises,\"; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/11/eng@/~cl_5__para_a__subpara_ii",
