      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/11/eng@/~cl_7",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (2) the following subsection: \"(2A) The Ruler or the Yang di-Pertua Negeri, as the case may be, may appoint any of the persons specified in subsection (2) to perform the functions of the Chairman during the period in which the Chairman is for any reason unable to perform his functions, and the person shall, during the period in which he is performing the functions of the Chairman under this section, be deemed to be the Chairman.\";"
      }
    },
    {
